gate|noun|A1|6|home||A door in a fence or wall outside.|Close the gate, please.|cổng|
yard|noun|A1|6|home||The open space outside a house.|The children play in the yard.|cái sân|
thing|noun|A1|6|things||An object; something.|What is that thing?|đồ vật (thứ)|
envelope|noun|A1|7|things|✉️|A paper cover for a letter.|Put the letter in the envelope.|phong bì|
stamp|noun|A1|7|things||A small picture you stick on a letter before you send it.|I need a stamp for this letter.|con tem|
parcel|noun|A1|7|things|📦|Something wrapped in paper that you send.|A parcel comes for Mum.|bưu kiện|
newspaper|noun|A1|7|things|📰|Big sheets of paper with news, printed every day.|Grandpa reads the newspaper.|tờ báo|
magazine|noun|A1|7|things||A thin book with stories and pictures, printed every week or month.|I read a magazine about animals.|tạp chí|
radio|noun|A1|6|things|📻|A machine you listen to for music and news.|We listen to the radio in the car.|đài (radio)|
coin|noun|A1|6|things||A round piece of metal money.|I put a coin in my piggy bank.|đồng xu|
flag|noun|A1|6|things|🚩|A piece of cloth with colours that shows a country.|The Vietnamese flag is red with a yellow star.|lá cờ|
torch|noun|A1|7|things|🔦|A small light you carry in your hand.|Take a torch when it's dark.|đèn pin|plural=torches
rope|noun|A1|6|things||A long, thick string.|We pull the rope.|sợi dây thừng|
ice skates|noun|A1|7|sports||Boots with a blade for moving on ice.|I put on my ice skates.|giày trượt băng|
racket|noun|A1|6|sports|🎾|A bat with strings for hitting a ball.|I have a new tennis racket.|cái vợt|
